cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Planum, please cite it as below. Please also cite the data and
  atlases behind the views you use, and include the acknowledgements they
  require, both listed at
  https://planumatlas.com/docs/reference/references.html
type: software
title: Planum
abstract: >-
  An interactive, browser-based atlas of one real human brain (MGH CDMD
  subject sub_013), reconstructed with FreeSurfer from its own T1 scan, with
  diffusion tracts from the same person. Users can cut, measure and query the
  brain against cortical and subcortical atlases, function and deficit maps,
  stimulation data and stroke lesion cases, each traced to its cited source.
authors:
